    "detailed_description": "<strong>Salus per aquam</strong> is a metaphysical adventure set in a mysterious world that blends reality and dream.<br><br>Your goal is to reach the highest point of the protagonist's existence: a <strong>wooden mannequin</strong> with a strange mask on its face.<br>You will climb surreal objects in <strong>metaphysical landscapes</strong>, where each jump is crucial to avoid losing your climbing progress.<br><br>This journey is open to interpretation, allowing each player to discover a personal meaning and embark on a journey of self-discovery.<br><br>Key features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Climbing mechanics</strong>: Experience an oniric climbing game where precise movements and careful jumps are essential to progress.<br></li><li> <strong>Surreal environments</strong>: Explore enigmatic landscapes that challenge your perception.<br></li><li> <strong>Metaphysical themes</strong>: Immerse yourself in a silent narrative that encourages personal interpretation.<br></li><li> <strong>Original soundtrack</strong></li></ul><br><strong>Salus per aquam</strong> is tailored to the artistic tastes and skills of its sole developer, who presents this title as their first work.<br><br><strong>DISCLAIMER</strong>: This game was developed by a solo developer and, not having a team, the assets used to build the levels and mechanics are not entirely custom-made. However, each asset used was carefully chosen to create the specific scenarios of the title, and no asset was used without purpose or due to a lack of ideas.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Salus per aquam</strong> is a metaphysical adventure set in a mysterious world that blends reality and dream.<br><br>Your goal is to reach the highest point of the protagonist's existence: a <strong>wooden mannequin</strong> with a strange mask on its face.<br>You will climb surreal objects in <strong>metaphysical landscapes</strong>, where each jump is crucial to avoid losing your climbing progress.<br><br>This journey is open to interpretation, allowing each player to discover a personal meaning and embark on a journey of self-discovery.<br><br>Key features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Climbing mechanics</strong>: Experience an oniric climbing game where precise movements and careful jumps are essential to progress.<br></li><li> <strong>Surreal environments</strong>: Explore enigmatic landscapes that challenge your perception.<br></li><li> <strong>Metaphysical themes</strong>: Immerse yourself in a silent narrative that encourages personal interpretation.<br></li><li> <strong>Original soundtrack</strong></li></ul><br><strong>Salus per aquam</strong> is tailored to the artistic tastes and skills of its sole developer, who presents this title as their first work.<br><br><strong>DISCLAIMER</strong>: This game was developed by a solo developer and, not having a team, the assets used to build the levels and mechanics are not entirely custom-made. However, each asset used was carefully chosen to create the specific scenarios of the title, and no asset was used without purpose or due to a lack of ideas.",
    "short_description": "Salus per aquam is a climbing game set in a dreamlike world where the goal is to reach the highest point of the protagonist's existence by climbing surreal objects and navigating metaphysical landscapes.",
